{"seq":1,"slug":"test-strategies","title":"CI 测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/test-strategies","wordCount":661,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-测试策略\">CI 测试策略</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI 中的测试策略决定了<strong>什么时候运行什么类型的测试</strong>。测试金字塔（Test Pyramid）是经典的指导原则：底层是大量快速的单元测试，中间是适量的集成测试，顶层是少量的端到端测试。但在 CI 环境中，测试策略还需要考虑执行时间、资源成本和反馈质量的三角平衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[Pre-commit Hooks]&#10;    B --&gt; C[CI 触发]&#10;    C --&gt; D[快速检查层]&#10;    D --&gt; E[单元测试层]&#10;    E --&gt; F[集成测试层]&#10;    F --&gt; G[E2E 测试层]&#10;    G --&gt; H[性能测试层]&#10;    subgraph 2 分钟内&#10;        D&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 5 分钟内&#10;        E&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 15 分钟内&#10;        F&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 30 分钟内&#10;        G&#10;        H&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[代码提交] --&gt; B[Pre-commit Hooks]\n    B --&gt; C[CI 触发]\n    C --&gt; D[快速检查层]\n    D --&gt; E[单元测试层]\n    E --&gt; F[集成测试层]\n    F --&gt; G[E2E 测试层]\n    G --&gt; H[性能测试层]\n    subgraph 2 分钟内\n        D\n    end\n    subgraph 5 分钟内\n        E\n    end\n    subgraph 15 分钟内\n        F\n    end\n    subgraph 30 分钟内\n        G\n        H\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>执行速度</th>\n<th>CI 执行频率</th>\n<th>覆盖范围</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>反馈价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>&lt; 1min</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>语法/类型</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>1-3min</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>函数/模块</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>3-10min</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>模块交互</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E2E 测试</td>\n<td>10-30min</td>\n<td>PR/合并</td>\n<td>用户流程</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能测试</td>\n<td>10-60min</td>\n<td>定时/发布前</td>\n<td>性能指标</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全扫描</td>\n<td>5-15min</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>漏洞检测</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分层测试执行\">分层测试执行</h2><p>分层执行的核心思想是 <strong>Fail Fast</strong>：先运行最快、最可能失败的测试，只有通过后才运行慢速测试。这最大化了反馈速度。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  fast-checks:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm run lint&#10;      - run: pnpm -r typecheck&#10;      - run: pnpm vitest --run --reporter=verbose&#10;&#10;  integration:&#10;    needs: fast-checks&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    services:&#10;      postgres:&#10;        image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;        env:&#10;          POSTGRES_DB: test&#10;          POSTGRES_USER: test&#10;          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test&#10;        ports: [&#39;5432:5432&#39;]&#10;        options: &gt;-&#10;          --health-cmd pg_isready --health-interval 10s --health-timeout 5s --health-retries 5&#10;&#10;&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm test:integration&#10;        env:&#10;          DATABASE_URL: postgresql://test:test@localhost:5432/test&#10;&#10;  e2e:&#10;    needs: fast-checks&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        shard: [1, 2]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: ./.github/actions/setup-pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm playwright install --with-deps chromium&#10;      - run: pnpm playwright test --shard=${{ matrix.shard }}/2&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        if: failure()&#10;        with:&#10;          name: playwright-report-${{ matrix.shard }}&#10;          path: playwright-report/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  fast-checks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./.github/actions/setup-pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm -r typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9