:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, branches: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, functions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, statements: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  newCode: { lines: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, branches: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, functions: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, statements: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>覆盖率报告应直接展示在 PR 中，让审查者一目了然。好的覆盖率工具还能标注哪些新增行未被覆盖，引导开发者补充测试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务容器与测试环境\">服务容器与测试环境</h2><p>集成测试需要外部服务（数据库、缓存、消息队列）。GitHub Actions 的 <code>services</code> 字段提供了声明式的服务容器管理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  postgres:&#10;    image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;    env:&#10;      POSTGRES_DB: test&#10;      POSTGRES_USER: test&#10;      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test&#10;    ports: [&#39;5432:5432&#39;]&#10;    options: &gt;-&#10;      --health-cmd pg_isready --health-interval 10s --health-timeout 5s --health-retries 5&#10;&#10;&#10;  redis:&#10;    image: redis:7-alpine&#10;    ports: [&#39;6379:6379&#39;]&#10;    options: &gt;-&#10;      --health-cmd &quot;redis-cli ping&quot; --health-interval 10s --health-timeout 5s --health-retries 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_USER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5432:5432'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --health-cmd pg_isready --health-interval 10s --health-timeout 5s --health-retries 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis:7-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'6379:6379'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      --health-cmd \"redis-cli ping\" --health-interval 10s --health-timeout 5s --health-retries 5</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>options</code> 中的 health check 确保服务完全就绪后才开始测试，避免&quot;连接拒绝&quot;类的 flaky 失败。</p>\n<p>对于更复杂的环境需求，可以使用 <strong>Docker Compose</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"steps:&#10;  - name: Start services&#10;    run: docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml up -d&#10;  - name: Wait for services&#10;    run: |&#10;      timeout 60 bash -c &#39;until docker compose exec db pg_isready; do sleep 1; done&#39;&#10;  - name: Run tests&#10;    run: pnpm test:integration&#10;  - name: Cleanup&#10;    if: always()&#10;    run: docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml down -v\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Start services</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml up -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Wait for services</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      timeout 60 bash -c 'until docker compose exec db pg_isready; do sleep 1; done'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Run tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm test:integration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Cleanup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml down -v</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>测试策略的核心是分层执行——快速检查优先，Fail Fast 最大化反馈速度</li>\n<li>增量覆盖率比全局覆盖率更有价值——只检查新代码的覆盖率避免遗留代码拖累</li>\n<li>GitHub Actions 的 services 字段提供声明式服务容器，health check 避免 flaky 失败</li>\n<li>E2E 测试使用分片（shard）并行化，失败时上传报告 artifact 辅助调试</li>\n<li>测试层之间通过 <code>needs</code> 建立依赖，确保快速层通过后才运行慢速层</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CI 测试策略","id":"ci-测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分层测试执行","id":"分层测试执行"},{"level":2,"text":"测试覆盖率门禁","id":"测试覆盖率门禁"},{"level":2,"text":"服务容器与测试环境","id":"服务容器与测试环境"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Actions 性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions/actions-optimization"},"next":{"title":"并行测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/ci-cd-pipelines/testing-in-ci/parallel-testing"}}